<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Sign in · Burrow</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-dvh bg-base-100 text-base-content p-6">
    <main id="sign-in-options" class="mx-auto max-w-md space-y-6 py-10">
      <img src={~p"/images/burrow-mark.svg"} alt="Burrow" width="48" height="48" />
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Welcome to Burrow</h1>
      <.form for={@form} action="/auth/passkey" method="post" id="passkey-sign-in">
        <button class="btn btn-primary w-full" type="submit">Sign in with a passkey</button>
      </.form>
      <section class="space-y-4" aria-labelledby="first-sign-in">
        <h2 id="first-sign-in" class="text-xl font-semibold">First time signing in?</h2>
        <p>Use your invitation link on this device. You can set up Face ID, Touch ID or another passkey afterward.</p>
        <div :if={@mail?}>
          <p>Or get a setup code at your invited email address. No QR scan needed.</p>
          <.form for={@form} action="/auth/email/setup" method="post" id="email-setup-request" class="space-y-3 mt-4">
            <.input id="setup-email" name="email" value="" type="email" label="Email address" autocomplete="email" required class="input w-full placeholder:text-subtle" />
            <button class="btn btn-outline w-full" type="submit">Email me a setup code</button>
          </.form>
        </div>
        <p :if={!@mail?} id="email-setup-unavailable">Email sign-in is not configured on this install. Ask your Burrow admin for an invitation or sign-in link that you can open on this device.</p>
      </section>
      <section :if={@sent?} id="email-setup-code" class="space-y-4" aria-live="polite">
        <p>If your account is invited and has no passkey yet, we’ll email a code. Return here to enter it. Codes expire in 30 minutes.</p>
        <p :if={@error?} role="alert">That code could not be used. Check it or request a new one.</p>
        <.form for={@form} action="/auth/email/complete" method="post" id="email-setup-complete" class="space-y-3">
          <.input id="setup-code" name="code" value="" label="Setup code" autocomplete="one-time-code" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" required maxlength="64" class="input w-full placeholder:text-subtle" />
          <button class="btn btn-primary w-full" type="submit">Continue</button>
        </.form>
      </section>
      <p class="text-sm">Already set up a passkey but cannot use it? Ask your admin for a recovery link.</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
